                            <li class="leaderboard-item"><span class="rank rank-2">2</span><span class="name">九阴真经</span><span class="desc">天下武学总纲</span></li>
                            <li class="leaderboard-item"><span class="rank rank-3">3</span><span class="name">葵花宝典</span><span class="desc">欲练此功，必先…</span></li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                     <div id="beauties" class="leaderboard-panel">
                        <ul class="leaderboard-list">
                            <li class="leaderboard-item"><span class="rank rank-1">1</span><span class="name">林仙儿</span><span class="desc">天下第一美人</span></li>
                            <li class="leaderboard-item"><span class="rank rank-2">2</span><span class="name">石观音</span><span class="desc">艳冠武林，心如蛇蝎</span></li>
                            <li class="leaderboard-item"><span class="rank rank-3">3</span><span class="name">邀月宫主</span><span class="desc">风华绝代，冷若冰霜</span></li>
